  "state_template": "state_faces",
  "notes": "EXPERIMENTAL. Nobody has scripted the way out of the village yet (run B got there with Saud's own controller). This walks with the left stick (PAD_FILE mask 0x10000 = stick only) toward the gate and waits for the draws count to drop (a load screen). If it never drops, the report says 'did not reach Now Loading' - it is not a hang.",
